---
// src/pages/disclaimer.astro

export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { ORGANIZATION_ID, SITE_ORIGIN } from "@/utils/site/schema";

const title = "Disclaimer - Sorted Tech";
const metaDescription =
  "Sorted Tech is transparent. See how we ensure content accuracy, handle sponsorships, and provide unbiased guidance.";

const structuredData = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  name: "Disclaimer",
  description: metaDescription,
  url: `${SITE_ORIGIN}/disclaimer`,
  publisher: {
    "@id": ORGANIZATION_ID,
  },
};
---

<BaseLayout {title} {metaDescription} {structuredData}>
  <section class="content-card rounded-none">
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>

    <p class="text-small mb-4">
      <strong>Effective Date:</strong> 10th October 2025.
    </p>

    <p>
      This page explains how you should interpret the information published on
      Sorted Tech (sortedtech.net).
    </p>

    <p class="mb-4 lg:mb-6">
      We'll keep this brief. The details below are what lawyers care about, even
      if no one else ever reads them.
    </p>

    <h2>1. General Information & Content Accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      Sorted Tech aims to help readers make smarter tech decisions by presenting
      clear, independent, and data-backed information. While we work hard to
      research, test, and verify everything we publish, the content on this site
      is still general information and not formal, certified advice.
    </p>
    <p>
      Technology evolves quickly. Prices change, firmware updates roll out,
      products get revised or discontinued, and details can shift over time. As
      a result, we cannot guarantee that every piece of information on the site
      will always be complete, current, or error-free.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our content consists of independent assessments based on research,
      testing, and real-world evaluation. We strive for objectivity and
      transparency, but these assessments ultimately reflect our judgment at the
      time of publication. They are guides to help you make informed decisions,
      not definitive conclusions.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4 lg:mb-6">
      If you notice something that seems inaccurate or outdated, don't hesitate
      to contact us with a correction.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Product Availability, Pricing & External Changes</h2>
    <p>
      Sorted Tech does not control product availability, pricing, shipping,
      warranty terms, platform policies, or any decisions made by third-party
      sellers or manufacturers. Any product details mentioned on the site are
      subject to change without notice.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4 lg:mb-6">
      Before making a purchase, please verify important information, such as
      price, availability, specifications, and warranty terms, directly with the
      manufacturer or retailer.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Interactive Checks & Results</h2>
    <p>
      Our tools let you run checks directly in your browser. These are practical
      utilities designed to help you observe things like display behavior, touch
      input, audio output, microphone input, and motion sensor response.
    </p>
    <p>
      These checks depend on your device hardware, browser support, permissions,
      operating system behavior, and current environment. They are not
      calibrated lab instruments and should not be treated as a repair
      diagnosis, warranty certificate, or proof that a device is defect-free.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4 lg:mb-6">
      Use them as a helpful first look. If your device shows a serious or
      repeated issue, confirm it with the manufacturer, service center, or
      another qualified technician.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Affiliations, Compensation & Independence</h2>
    <p>
      Currently, Sorted Tech does not accept sponsorships, paid placements, or
      affiliate commissions. If this changes in the future, we will clearly
      disclose any such relationships on a per-page basis, where relevant.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4 lg:mb-6">
      Regardless of any future partnerships, our goal will always be to maintain
      transparency, integrity, and independence in all evaluations.
    </p>

    <h2>5. External Links</h2>
    <p>
      Sorted Tech may link to external websites for reference or convenience. We
      do not have control over the content, policies, or practices of those
      third-party sites and cannot take responsibility for their accuracy,
      safety, or reliability.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4 lg:mb-6">
      Visiting external sites is at your own discretion.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      Sorted Tech is not liable for any loss, damage, or inconvenience arising
      from:
    </p>
    <ul class="mb-6 list-disc pl-6 lg:mb-8">
      <li>reliance on information published on the site,</li>
      <li>errors or outdated information, or</li>
      <li>actions taken based on our reviews, rankings, or recommendations.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Use the information here as a helpful guide. The final decision is always
      yours. Thank you for visiting Sorted Tech.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
